  "description": "Testing companion for OrionClock: a controllable FakeOrionClock whose time only moves when you Advance or SetUtcNow it, so TTL expiry, deadlines, and timer-driven cancellation fire deterministically without real delays. Built on Microsoft's FakeTimeProvider, so advancing it fires the timers created through it.",
